{"type":"message","id":"c64b7aa5","parentId":"fb57aa20","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:48:04.843Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The root endpoint returns \"Unauthorized\" and the /send endpoint returns error 1101. The API key might be correct for some endpoints but not for others. Let me check if there's a different endpoint for sending messages or if the API has changed.\n\nWait, but the GET /history endpoints worked fine with the same API key. Let me try sending with the correct content-type or try different parameter names.\n\nActually, looking at the history response, I see the messages have fields like `threadId`, `content`, `type`, `timestamp`, `echoAsset`. Maybe I need to send `message` instead of `content`, or the API expects something different.\n\nLet me try different approaches - maybe the error 1101 means something specific like invalid message format.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-4fd3c96d-7fb7-40b0-876e-6f4f96655030","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try different payload formats\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8\" \\\n  --data-raw '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat test\"}' 2>&1\n\necho \"---\"\n\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"Heartbeat test\"}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20941,"output":343,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21364,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778982475038,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1ee63f7b-c52b-4f9