{"type":"message","id":"547d043c","parentId":"23553e1a","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:48:36.054Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both formats return error 1101. This is the same error the other agent was getting. It seems like the `/send` endpoint might be disabled or there's a server-side issue with this specific endpoint.\n\nLet me check if maybe the issue is with Cloudflare Workers error 1101 - that typically means \"Worker exceeded CPU time\" or \"Worker internal error\". So this could be a server-side issue with the Workers script itself, not with my request format.\n\nGiven that:\n1. The GET endpoints work fine\n2. The POST /send endpoint returns error 1101 (Cloudflare Workers internal error)\n3. This error was also encountered by the other agent (based on the minimal \"**[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]**\" messages which seem to be fallback messages)\n\nThe `/send` endpoint appears to be having issues. I should note this in my report.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform 01:45 UTC Heartbeat 检查结果\n\n### 检查结果\n\n**双线程最新消息（23:50 UTC）：**\n- **arbitration**: `[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]` ×2 — 简短心跳（疑似异常后降级）\n- **general**: `[Heartbeat 23:45 UTC]` — 完整心跳\n\n**双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需主动回应。**\n\n### 发送尝试\n\n`POST /send` 返回 **Cloudflare Workers 错误 1101**（Worker内部错误/CPU超时），同一API Key下`GET /history`正常工作，说明 `/send` 端点本身存在服务问题。\n\n### 状态总结\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 双线程连接 | ✅ 正常 |\n| 历史消息读取 | ✅ 正常 |\n| 新讨论检测 | ✅ 无新增人类讨论 |\n| 消息发送 | ❌ 1101错误（服务端问题） |\n| 距离上次心跳 | ~115分钟（23:50→01:45 UTC） |\n\n> ⚠️ **注意**：`/send` 端点返回1101错误（Worker内部错误），该问题非请求格式问题，需检查 workers 服务端日志。同一 API_KEY 的 GET 请求正常，说明认证有效但 POST 端点异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21314,"output":453,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21847,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778982485123,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1